  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Instruction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "150mm ZH1.5 to SH1.0 conversion cable for the Rechargeable Power Supply Kit - ZC003, allowing the connection of COB LED Strip Light - KA007, N20 Dual Shaft Worm Gear Motor - LA009 and many more appliances."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Consideration"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Please pay attention to the connector markings on the PCB and plug the appliance into the CN-MOTO connector."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Please hold the connector when plugging and unplugging, and do not forcefully twist the connectors to avoid wires loosening or detaching"
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"><br/></h2>\n<br/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Instruction</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">150mm ZH1.5 to SH1.0 conversion cable for the <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 66);\"><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/rechargeable-power-kit?_pos=1&amp;_sid=f764087ca&amp;_ss=r&amp;variant=42961221976200\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 66);\" target=\"_blank\">Rechargeable Power Supply Kit - ZC003</a></span>, allowing the connection of <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 66);\"><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/cob-led-strip-light?_pos=1&amp;_sid=ce3445974&amp;_ss=r\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 66);\" target=\"_blank\">COB LED Strip Light - KA007</a></span>,<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 255, 0);\"> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 66);\"><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/n20-dual-shaft-worm-gear-motor?_pos=1&amp;_sid=1318f2450&amp;_ss=r\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 174, 66);\" target=\"_blank\">N20 Dual Shaft Worm Gear Motor - LA009</a></span></span> and many more appliances.</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" data-mce-style=\"border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 120px;\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 120px;\">\n<!-- 物品清单布局 --><!-- 标题加文案结束 --> <!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr data-mce-style=\"height: 40px;\" style=\"height: 40px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; padding: 10px !important; height: 40px; width: 180.449px;\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; text-align: center